<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>State - Tag - loommii</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/tags/state/</link><description>我的个人技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.165.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 01:28:43 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://loommii.github.io/en/tags/state/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Go Daily Question 074</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_074/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 20:44:58 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_074/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category><description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output of the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#10;&#10;import &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#10;&#10;func app() func(string) string {&#10; t := &amp;#34;Hi&amp;#34;&#10; c := func(b string) string {&#10; t = t &amp;#43; &amp;#34; &amp;#34; &amp;#43; b&#10; return t&#10; }&#10; return c&#10;}&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10; a := app()&#10; b := app()&#10; a(&amp;#34;go&amp;#34;)&#10; fmt.Println(b(&amp;#34;All&amp;#34;))&#10; fmt.Println(a(&amp;#34;All&amp;#34;))&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;A: Hi All; B: Hi go All; C: Hi; D: go Al&#10;&#10;&lt;details&gt;&#10; &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Closure&#10;&lt;code&gt;fmt.Println(b(&amp;quot;All&amp;quot;))&lt;/code&gt; outputs A (Hi All)&#10;&lt;code&gt;fmt.Println(a(&amp;quot;All&amp;quot;))&lt;/code&gt; outputs B (Hi go All)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>